-- upstream #935 (defect 1) — ALTER PAGE INSERT/REPLACE at a DOTTED DataGrid2
-- column target, with a body that is NOT a `column …` block.
--
-- This is the other half of #891, reached by the form #891's refusal points
-- authors at. `grid1.OrderNo` is a legitimate target; what is wrong is the
-- pairing. The executor routes an all-columns body to InsertColumns /
-- ReplaceColumn; anything else fell through to the generic widget path and was
-- serialized into the grid's COLUMN list, leaving a project mxbuild cannot LOAD:
--
--   ERROR: System.InvalidCastException: Unable to cast object of type
--   'Mendix.Modeler.WebUI.Forms.Widgets.LayoutWidgets.DivContainers.DivContainer'
--   to type 'Mendix.Modeler.WebUI.Forms.Widgets.CustomWidgets.WidgetObject'
--
-- Measured on Mendix 10.24.20.105674: before the fix `mxcli exec` printed
-- "Altered page" and `mx check` then aborted with the exception above, before
-- reaching a single check. After the fix the statement is refused and the
-- project still checks at 0 errors.
--
-- Setup (any DataGrid2 will do; `grid1.OrderNo` is the derived column name):
--
--   create or modify persistent entity Sample.Order ( OrderNo: String(50) );
--   create or replace page Sample.Order_Overview
--     ( Title: 'Orders', Layout: Atlas_Core.Atlas_Default )
--   { datagrid grid1 (datasource: database from Sample.Order) {
--       column colNo (caption: 'Order', attribute: OrderNo)
--   } }
--
-- Both statements below are REFUSED once applied to a project — that refusal is
-- the fix. To add a column, give the body a `column …` block. To edit a
-- customContent cell's contents, address the widget inside it by its own name
-- (#834 made those reachable), e.g. `insert into ctnCust { … }`.
--
-- NOT a `.fail.mdl`, for the reason spelled out in
-- 891-alter-page-bare-column-target.mdl: the guard is exec-time and
-- project-dependent, while that suffix means "must fail `mxcli check`" with no
-- project. `check` exits 0 here, which the harness would read as a regression.
--
--   mxcli exec 935-alter-page-widgets-at-column-target.mdl -p <app>.mpr  # refused
--
-- Unit coverage: mdl/backend/pagemutator/mutator_column_addressing_test.go

ALTER PAGE Sample.Order_Overview {
  INSERT AFTER grid1.OrderNo {
    CONTAINER ctnStray {
      DYNAMICTEXT txtStray (Content: '!')
    }
  }
};

ALTER PAGE Sample.Order_Overview {
  REPLACE grid1.OrderNo WITH {
    CONTAINER ctnStray2 {
      DYNAMICTEXT txtStray2 (Content: '!')
    }
  }
};
